# Scrapyard Haven's battery dump with a suit (CIPlay scrapyard_haven_acidsuit, 11-12 w15 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# The suit box shsuits (10.5 -52) gives 180 s of suit; into the acid zone sh_acid (16 -55) to the spares box (17.8 -56) and
# back, unhurt, the acid still there.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Scrapyard Haven keep
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
walk 6 -52 to 9.5 -52.5
use shsuits
expect shown shacid
walk 9.5 -52.5 to 13 -54 to 16 -55 to 17.2 -55.6
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Scrappers' spares
wait 2
expect item Battery 2
walk 17.2 -55.6 to 16 -55 to 13 -54 to 10 -54
expect unhurt
